   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The predicative and adverbial superlative",
     "texto": [
      "Unlike the superlative placed before a noun (*der schnellste Zug*), when the quality closes the predicative sentence the fixed particle **am** is always used: **Der ICE fährt am schnellsten** (the ICE travels fastest of all); **Dieser Flug ist am günstigsten** (this flight is the cheapest); **Im Urlaub reist man am bequemsten** (on holiday you travel most comfortably).",
      "Key irregular forms: **gut → am besten**; **viel → am meisten**; **gern → am liebsten**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
